OL,3,GNEWSATrain cancellations ongoing after
OL,4,Awires damage
OL,5,
OL,6,FA railway line between two counties has
OL,7,Fbeen suspended for tests to be carried
OL,8,Fout following damage to overhead wires.
OL,10,FTrain operator Great Northern said the
OL,11,Fdamage took place between Ely,
OL,12,FCambridgeshire, and King's Lynn,
OL,13,FNorfolk, on Monday, however, disruption
OL,14,Fhas continued into Wednesday and is
OL,15,Fexpected until 18:00 BST.
OL,17,FWhile lines reopened on Wednesday
OL,18,Fmorning, the train company said recent
OL,19,Fchecks had shown more testing and
OL,20,Finspections were needed before trains
OL,21,Fcould run safely.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
